WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.380
Never have I ever seen a true toddler size bathtub until now.

00:00:04.381 --> 00:00:06.941
My baby girl outgrew her infant stage tub,

00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:10.221
but she's still too small for the bathroom bathtub.

00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:13.741
This snuggle toddler bathtub is for ages 1 to 3.

00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:17.221
It's huge for a toddler and it's like their own little bathtub.

00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:19.301
And it's made with safety in mind.

00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:22.181
There's a bump on the inside so they sit up in place,

00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:24.501
A foam back rest to support their back,

00:00:24.502 --> 00:00:27.221
and it's non slip to keep their feet from sliding.

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:29.901
There's even a plug at the bottom to drain the water out.

00:00:29.902 --> 00:00:33.861
Colder nights are here and a warm bath makes bedtime so much easier.

00:00:33.862 --> 00:00:36.881
You can grab one for your little one link below in the orange cart.
